    <!-- Import text -->
    <string name="import_title">Import text</string>
    <string name="import_desc">Paste ASCII art or open a .txt file to render it back into an image. Characters outside the table are substituted with the closest match.\n\nText carrying ANSI color codes (this app\'s "16 colors" and "True color" formats, or colored output copied from a terminal) is detected automatically and its colors are restored as-is. A plain txt has no colors at all — with the "Colorful" style you get a synthetic palette derived from luma, not the original colors.</string>
