    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_message">ASCII Image Converter v%1$s\n\nThe image is scaled down to a character grid, every cell is mapped to one of 92 characters by its BT.601 luma, then drawn cell by cell. Color fill, char reverse and color reverse are all adjustable.\n\nThe result can be saved as PNG or TXT, copied or shared.\n\nEverything runs on device, nothing is uploaded.</string>
